		{
			"id": "EnemyArchetype:Gastronom.Butcher",
			"displayName": "Butcher",
			"description": "The ham of this meat counter queen have long since been coated in a slimy layer of cadaveric bacteria, and the putrid stench of her own innards ranks as the foulest of all the rotten, expired goods in the grocery store. But don’t be fooled: this decaying carcass hasn’t forgotten how to wield a meat hook and a cleaver.\r\nIn the old days, she at least used to ask how much you wanted her to chop off.",
